#: ../../../how-to/enable-smart-cards-in-snapped-browsers.md:103
#: ../../../how-to/enable-smart-cards-in-snapped-browsers.md:163
msgid ""
"If you're running Ubuntu on a different CPU architecture than Intel 64 and "
