#: ../../../how-to/enable-smart-cards-in-snapped-browsers.md:126
msgid "Go to {menuselection}`Apps --> Chromium Web Browser`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/enable-smart-cards-in-snapped-browsers.md:139
msgid "Load the smart card module in Chromium:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/enable-smart-cards-in-snapped-browsers.md:141
